1
00:00:03,253 --> 00:00:05,583
(Leonard:)So, what kind of cruise is this
you're going on?

2
00:00:05,755 --> 00:00:08,425
(Mrs Cooper:)It's called
the Born Again Boat Ride.

3
00:00:08,633 --> 00:00:13,723
(Mrs Cooper:)Christian Quarterly gave it
their highest rating: five thorny crowns.

4
00:00:14,597 --> 00:00:16,597
(Mrs Cooper:)I do wish you'd come with me,
Sheldon.

5
00:00:16,766 --> 00:00:20,226
Oh, well, Mom, if I did,
it would be conclusive proof...

6
00:00:20,395 --> 00:00:22,395
(Sheldon:)...that your God can work miracles.

7
00:00:23,273 --> 00:00:26,903
(Mrs Cooper:)You're missing out. It's gonna be
wall-to-wall fun. It's all themed.

8
00:00:27,068 --> 00:00:28,948
There's Jonah-and-the-whale
watching.

9
00:00:30,447 --> 00:00:32,617
All you can eat
Last Supper Buffet.

10
00:00:32,782 --> 00:00:36,122
And my personal favorite,
Gunning with God.

11
00:00:36,911 --> 00:00:39,621
(Leonard:)What's Gunning with God?
I'm afraid to ask, heh.

12
00:00:39,789 --> 00:00:41,879
Oh, it is a hoot and a haIf.

13
00:00:42,042 --> 00:00:44,542
(Mrs Cooper:)You write your sins
on a clay pigeon...

14
00:00:44,711 --> 00:00:49,091
...they fire them up in the air, and you
pulverize them with a 12-gauge shotgun...

15
00:00:49,257 --> 00:00:52,217
(Mrs Cooper:)...full of our Lord's forgiveness.

16
00:00:53,219 --> 00:00:56,719
(Sheldon:)Frankly, Mom, I'm encouraged to see
how advanced your group has become...

17
00:00:56,890 --> 00:01:02,020
(Sheldon:)...willing to sail out into the ocean
without fear of falling off the edge.

